{"id":"u-f56f1f10-472d-4907-a003-1e3366284ff8","src":"community","title":"ToguroMaxxing (Heavy-ish Duty)","author":"Rohit B.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/NW6YCj-toguromaxxing-heavy-ish-duty-or-upper-full-body","desc":"A 2-3 day Heavy Duty–inspired program initially built by compressing a favorite 4-day 'Guts Lifting Program' by Natural Hypertrophy™️, split into higher exercise frequency without losing its identity. It eventually evolved into a  PPL style  routine to cut the lengths of individual sessions. \n\nI built it for my personal life and  recovery needs. Not meant to be applicable or optimal for the general public. \n\nSplit says one week but it's supposed to be the same week ad infinitum unless you get bored or it stops working. \n\nUpper day prioritizes pressing, arms, neck, and upper-body specialization. Full-body day anchors around deadlifts, lower body, pulling, and accessories.\n\nLow volume. High effort. Weekly exposure to key lifts instead of rotating them every two weeks.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-08-14T22:52:36.458Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Full body (Push focus)","Full body (Pull focus)","Full body (Legs focus)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Decline Push Up","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":2}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Pullover (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":2}]},{"n":"Neck Curl","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Walking Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":5,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]}